Fuutarou
\[That dream again\]
The Next Day
# sprite right raiha determined
raiha: Wake up brother, it's time to wake up.
fuutarou: I dun wanna. My head hurts, let me keep sleeping forever.
# sprite right raiha gentle_worry
raiha: If you keep hurting yourself like that, you'll get brain damage!
fuutarou: Ugh, fine. What time is it anyway?
# sprite left isanari hungover
isanari: IT'S 7:30 IN THE MORNING!
# sprite right raiha concerned_scold
raiha: Dad, I told you not to drink so much, it's not good for your health!
Isanari stands and stretches.
isanari: My health, huh?
raiha: Jeez, dad. Go on ahead, brother, I'll tend to this.
fuutarou: ...Right, I'll see you at breakfast.
Fuutarou looks at his phone to confirm the time before he leaves it on his futon. He decided to change to his normal clothes before leaving.
# show image bg ch02-onsen-courtyard-window-corridor align 0 with fade
As Fuutarou was walking towards the breakfast area, the bell once again caught his attention in the corner of his eye.
fuutarou: That's right, when is Miku supposed to be here?
Right as he said that, he noticed a girl in a dress run across the hallway.
fuutarou: \[Was that Yotsuba? No, that girl's hair was longer.\]
As Fuutarou turned the corner, he saw 4 Renas standing there, all wearing their hats in a way that covered their faces.
fuutarou: You...have got to be kidding me.
rena_1: Uesugi Fuutarou-kun
rena_2: Have you missed me?
rena_3: We haven't seen each other in a long time.
rena_4: What do you say we-
fuutarou: What are you idiots doing!?
Fuutarou starts running towards them.
rena_4: H-Hey, no runni-
fuutarou: I've had enough of your disguise crap!
All the Renas panic and start running in separate directions. Fuutarou stops to see which one he should go after first.
fuutarou: Don't think I'm the same as before, I've had gym workout training like never before! That damn Takeda forced me to after he realized I had experience with it!
Fuutarou went after the first Rena, she wasn't too fast, but she never stopped to look behind her, clearly confident in her pace. However, Fuutarou cut her off after taking a shortcut.
rena_1: Ah, looks like you've caught up to me. How impressive, good for you.
fuutarou: \[What a scowl, not to mention that dominant aura, but I can't deny her fragile interior. Yes, it can't be anyone else\] "You're Nino!"
...
nino: Heh, well done. Though it just makes me wonder why you weren't able to tell it was Yotsuba yesterday.
fuutarou: Ah, well. I can do it, I just need a little bit of time.
nino: \[Then how could you tell Miku wasn't here so fast?\] "Heh, you're smart enough to tutor all of us, but you're such an idiot when it comes to love."
fuutarou: Tell me why you guys are doing this.
nino: Like I'd tell you so easily, bleh. Go on now, there's 3 others running around.
fuutarou: Fine, I'll get the reasoning sooner or later. Ah, Nino.
nino: What is it?
fuutarou: I'm sorry...I was never able to answer you properly.
nino: What? Oh, hahahaha!
fuutarou: Wh-why are you laughing!?
nino: Did you think I didn't know what your answer would be, I loved you, silly. Of course I knew what the answer was! I kept trying in hopes of changing your mind, but I'm not as dense as you are!
Nino slaps Fuutarou's back.
nino: Although, if Miku is correct...You're not dense, you're just stupid!
fuutarou: Urk! Well, I-
nino: Don't bother, go find the others.
fuutarou: Right...
As Fuutarou started walking away, Nino couldn't help but look at him.
nino: \[I love my sisters. I loved that man. Even though I pushed him away, he continued to help us. So much has happened...I began to believe I've moved on. But, if what she says is true...Could I begin to hope again?\]
fuutarou: Ah, Nino.
nino: hmm?
fuutarou: It's embarrassing to admit, especially since I know you'll just tease me...But..You were the reason I began to look at love differently.
No response. Fuutarou began to wonder why there was no response, as he turned to see what Nino could be doing, his eyes were covered by her hands.
nino: You can't see me right now...If you saw how red my face is right now, I'd never forgive you.
fuutarou: ...Alright, I get it. I'm quite pathetic, aren't I?
nino: Hell yeah, you are! You tactless loser! If you get your heart broken, just know that you'll have to beg for me to pick your sorry ass up!
fuutarou: Yeah, I know. Thank you, Nino.
nino: "Ah! Stop being so sappy and just go!"\[I'm sure these feelings will change, for better or worse, but as of right now, I love my sisters and I love Fuu-kun. I love them so much.\]
Fuutarou runs away, ready to find the second Rena.
…
...
# show image bg ch02-onsen-quintuplets-tatami-room align 0 with fade
After some looking around, he found her in the room where the quints were sleeping. While looking for his surroundings in case Maruo saw them, he was able to cut the second Rena off when she took a turn into a dead end.
fuutarou: Hah..Hah...I got you.
The second Rena grins.
rena_2: Well, Uesugi Fuutarou-kun...Can you discern who I am?
fuutarou: \[Her smile, sense of confidence and general mannerisms. This regal presence combined with a lazy attitude. No doubt about it.\] "You're Ichika!"
ichika: My my, not bad, Fuutarou-kun. To think that before, you had no idea how to tell us apart unless we told you directly.
fuutarou: Heh, there was no mistaking you, you lazy bum with the mask of beauty.
ichika: Oh, are you trying to flatter your big sister~?
fuutarou: In a way, I guess. I mean, you are the "Ace" of the family after all.
Ichika's eyes widened, as she looked up at Fuutarou, he had a grin reminiscent of the one Ichika would often give Fuutarou. Ichika simply laughed once she realized what Fuutarou was doing. Once she stopped, she walked towards Fuutarou and patted him on the head. Surprised, Fuutarou took a step back.
# sprite right ichika laughing
ichika: Hehe, What's wrong? It's natural for the big sister to worry.
fuutarou: That part of you will never change, huh?
# sprite right ichika sad_reflective
ichika: You know...I was scared when Y-...when the other Rena suggested we do this...The last time I put on a disguise, it was to hurt my sister.
As her voice stutters, Fuutarou gathers his courage and returns the head pat he had received earlier.
fuutarou: You already know what you did was wrong, you've apologized...and Miku forgave you. What's there to be worried about?
# sprite right ichika warm_smile
ichika: Oh, Fuutarou-kun, that part of you hasn't changed either, huh?
fuutarou: What do you mean?
# sprite right ichika embarrassed
ichika: Oh, whatever! Go on, there should be other Renas out there, go get them!
fuutarou: Heh, all right, Thank you, Ichika.
ichika: Huh? For what?
fuutarou: For being a role model for your sisters...they've all become better in hopes as being as good as their big sister.
ichika: Just like how Raiha wishes to do her best for her big brother, huh?
fuutarou: Heh, I guess so.
As Fuutarou went to look for the others, Ichika couldn't help but have a massive grin on her face. She yells out.
# sprite right ichika laughing
ichika: Hey! If you're ever feeling sad, remember that your big sister will give you a lap pillow!
fuutarou: I'll keep it in mind!
…
…
# show image bg ch02-onsen-reception-staircase align 0 with fade
After more looking, Fuutarou notices one of the Renas standing in the middle of the check-in hall. As Fuutarou gets closer, she turns around.
rena_3: Good job finding me, Uesugi Fuutarou-kun. Tell me, can you tell who I am?
fuutarou: \[This feeling, it's calm, but childish, yet mature. Her easy-going expression that clearly wants to take care of you..It's clear who this is.\] "Heh, of course I can. If you think I can't recognize the whole reason I got into this mess to begin with, you're mistaken! You're Itsuki!"
rena_3: Eh?
fuutarou: Hmm, what is it?
rena_3: Fuutarou, I'm Miku…
...
Fuutarou couldn't help but laugh.
rena_3: Huh? Why are you laughing, F-Fuutarou!?
fuutarou: Do you honestly think you can fool me, Itsuki? I know the 'Meat Bun Demon' when I see it!
# sprite right itsuki indignant
itsuki: Wh-Who are you calling 'Meat Bun Demon'!? Gosh, why are you always so tactless!? Ah.
fuutarou: You did a great job, you're better at disguising than before.
# sprite right itsuki flustered
Itsuki blushes, realizing her mistake. Fuutarou reaches in his pocket, but as he notices nothing is there other than the coins his dad gave him, he grabs his head.
fuutarou: Ah, I left it at home. Anyway, Itsuki, tell me where the last Rena is!
itsuki: You already found the others? Well, I'm not telling you, that's the point of this.
fuutarou: ...And what is the point of this?
itsuki: If you don't already know, then you'll have to find the last Rena.
fuutarou: Ugh, what a pain...Everything has been a pain since I met you losers!
itsuki: Eek!
As Itsuki stepped back, Fuutarou calmed down.
fuutarou: Even though you guys have put me in this hell, I can't help but feel thankful. I was your tutor, but I learned far more from you guys than I could ever teach you. I don't take pride in many things, but you guys are the greatest people I could have met. So...Thank you, Itsuki.
# sprite right itsuki joyful
itsuki: Hehe, You're welcome, Uesugi-kun!
Fuutarou leaves with a smile.
# sprite right itsuki thoughtful
itsuki: We've taught you a lot, huh? Well, if what she said is true...It's time for your final lesson, Uesugi-kun.
…
...
# show image bg ch02-onsen-stairwell-landing align 0 with fade
Fuutarou's stamina finally runs out, making him walk in his quest for the final Rena. As he finds a set of stairs, he decides to sit down. After a while, he sees a shadow loom over him.
fuutarou: There you are, the final Rena.
He looks up to see the fourth and final Rena.
rena_4: Good to see you again, Uesugi Fuutarou-kun. I assume you're familiar with the process now?
fuutarou: Yeeep, let's get this over with."\[This feeling...It's childish, caring, and optimistic. But underneath, there's a feeling that doesn't sit right. It's not like Miku's self-image issues, nor like Ichika's regret, it's something else, and I know it has to do with me\] "Ichika slipped up, so I demand an explanation. What's the point of this, Yotsuba!?
yotsuba: Ahaha, you did it, huh? Tell me, Uesugi-san, do you doubt your ability to find us now? Do you think you can tell Grandpa you're able to tell us apart?
fuutarou: Ah, so you were the eavesdropper... But I guess you're right...I was able to tell you all apart. Was that the whole reason for this?
yotsuba: Well, part of it. You being able to do this means you like us all. You told us the same thing back during the festival, but now I see that you're finally able to live up to that statement. For that reason, I can ask you this with confidence…
Fuutarou ponders what she could be talking about, but he could tell, if even for a second, what Yotsuba was ready to ask.
fuutarou: Wait, Yot-
yotsuba: Do you really love me?
End of Chapter 5

